{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by a strange forest, you come across a large, peculiar metal cylinder in the middle of a murky marsh. It has slimy, rusty ladder rungs along one side. You don't know why it looks slightly familiar, but somehow you are sure that you need to find a way to get across the marsh and investigate what's down below. As you discover old crusty machines, tunnel entrances, a radio shack, and a handful of strangers, you begin to piece together the history of the experiment that had long gone amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Epsilon Outcome is a point-and-click adventure game with amnesia, disappearances, strange men in gray hazmat suits, and 8-bit graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is the developer's culmination of years of art, music, writing and programming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game's for you if you're into:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro games, science fiction, or mysteries </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie/grassroots stories, art and music </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving puzzles on your own or with a friend. Works with Steam Remote Play Together! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with characters and solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LucasArts-style dialog, simplified Sierra-style interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world of 39 screens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original 14-song soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online hint guide if you're in a pickle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game features audio design, the game can be completed without sound.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"713858ab262508c721c2fe12ff3681bf88d5b00e.jpg","localized_name":"Battery Issue Solved","name":"Battery Issue Solved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1234020/713858ab262508c721c2fe12ff3681bf88d5b00e.jpg"},{"icon":"b74469ef48113cdfa6c560bca6c195340a9352d5.jpg","localized_name":"Ascend to New Heights","name":"Ascend to New Heights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1234020/b74469ef48113cdfa6c560bca6c195340a9352d5.jpg"},{"icon":"a6b42dc35965f77e50c613d0e84ded5cfc0e2267.jpg","localized_name":"Shellshocked!","name":"Shellshocked!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1234020/a6b42dc35965f77e50c613d0e84ded5cfc0e2267.jpg"},{"icon":"cf2d14edb8b63a6c546ff1afe6454edb5dff4492.jpg","localized_name":"Membership Achieved","name":"Membership Achieved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1234020/cf2d14edb8b63a6c546ff1afe6454edb5dff4492.jpg"},{"icon":"fe5bef5851d44d7950e42fe897dce29ce0b4cfbe.jpg","localized_name":"Power On!","name":"Power On!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1234020/fe5bef5851d44d7950e42fe897dce29ce0b4cfbe.jpg"},{"icon":"9bb6b5fd119cd8dc50b23dfdbb7388952d44d046.jpg","localized_name":"Through the Threshold","name":"Through the Threshold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1234020/9bb6b5fd119cd8dc50b23dfdbb7388952d44d046.jpg"},{"icon":"44a6ff4e4d0c927c83476965839af50923d3ecdf.jpg","localized_name":"Master Message Decoded","name":"Master Message Decoded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1234020/44a6ff4e4d0c927c83476965839af50923d3ecdf.jpg"},{"icon":"e3c98955a0fd68b82a9a7ac84c94f014c5981e1e.jpg","localized_name":"You Didn't Die","name":"You Didn't Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1234020/e3c98955a0fd68b82a9a7ac84c94f014c5981e1e.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1234020?t=1775319533","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775319533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775319533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775319533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Version 1.2 Release</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234020/extras/77665e1c240a7f77e49cffe0c5d1ffd0.avif?t=1775319533\" width=686 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New features to keep up with cutting edge computing technology:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI improvements that work better with tablets and smartphones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redesign of Screen #40 for better orientation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated game engine, to ensure that &quot;things that ain't broke&quot; are still fixed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elimination of the &quot;birds chirping while indoors&quot; bug that probably very few noticed</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by a strange forest, you come across a large, peculiar metal cylinder in the middle of a murky marsh. It has slimy, rusty ladder rungs along one side. You don't know why it looks slightly familiar, but somehow you are sure that you need to find a way to get across the marsh and investigate what's down below. As you discover old crusty machines, tunnel entrances, a radio shack, and a handful of strangers, you begin to piece together the history of the experiment that had long gone amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Epsilon Outcome is a point-and-click adventure game with amnesia, disappearances, strange men in gray hazmat suits, and 8-bit graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is the developer's culmination of years of art, music, writing and programming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game's for you if you're into:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro games, science fiction, or mysteries </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie/grassroots stories, art and music </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving puzzles on your own or with a friend. Works with Steam Remote Play Together! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with characters and solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LucasArts-style dialog, simplified Sierra-style interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world of 39 screens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original 14-song soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online hint guide if you're in a pickle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game features audio design, the game can be completed without sound.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Kenneth A. Perrine"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1234020/header.jpg?t=1775319533","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Monterey 12.7.6<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, In